"""fusion_describe — self-describe the bridge's verb surface for Adom Bridge.

ab v1.9.23+ added a Verbs tab to each bridge's detail pop-out (lists verbs,
expands each for its I/O + timeout + status schema, with an inline runner). ab
does NOT hardcode a cloud-owned bridge's verbs, so the bridge must self-describe.
ab POSTs {command:"describe", args:{}} and caches the result at ~/.adom/bridge-verbs/.

Each entry: name, summary, input, output, timeoutSeconds, statusVerb, longRunning,
example. Keep this in step with the actual handlers as verbs are added.
"""

